      "title": "Russia interfered in 2016 Brexit referendum, says UK PM Andy Burnham",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/world-news/russia-interfered-in-2016-brexit-referendum-says-uk-pm-andy-burnham-126101200016_1.html",
      "description": "UK Prime Minister Andy Burnham says it is clear that Russia interfered with Britain's vote to leave the European Union, adding it was important to put Moscow's tampering on the record because countries across Europe are facing the same threat.\nIn excerpts from \"The Rest is Politics'' podcast released Sunday, Burnham said that when he became prime minister in July he asked his advisers whether Russia had interfered with the 2016 referendum. The full podcast is scheduled to drop on Monday.\n\"I've had the clear answer that yes, there was,'' Burnham said. \"These things are important now to put clearly on the record and I believe help voters in Germany and France understand that some of this politics is instigated via our enemies, namely Russia.\"\nRussia has long said it does not meddle in other countries' elections or referendums.\nBurnham's comments come as U.K. intelligence agencies warn about the increasing threat of Russian interference in Britain's democratic institutions. The ...",
